---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---
<SiteLayout
  title="Favourites - Places I want to visit"
  description="Places I've already been, and would happily visit again."
>
  <h1>My favourites</h1>
  <p>A few places I've already been, and would happily visit again.</p>
  <h2>Places I'd go back to</h2>
  <ul class="card-grid" role="list">
    <li class="card">
      <h3>Whitby</h3>
      <p>Fish and chips on the harbour, then the steps up to the abbey.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="card">
      <h3>The Yorkshire Dales</h3>
      <p>Stone walls, waterfalls and a long walk between villages.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="card">
      <h3>Edinburgh in August</h3>
      <p>Busy, loud and full of things to see on every street.</p>
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p class="note">A note: I'll add more favourites as I travel.</p>
</SiteLayout>
